{
  "uid": "vankoo-traces",
  "title": "Vankoo · Trazas",
  "tags": [
    "vankoo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Dashboards de Vankoo",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "vankoo"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo leer este dashboard",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Una **traza** es el recorrido de una petición por los servicios (gateway → servicio → base de datos, Kafka, S3, OCR), con lo que tardó cada tramo (*span*). Las mandan los agentes de OpenTelemetry que el operador inyecta en cada servicio, y Tempo las guarda 48 h. El **mapa de servicios** muestra quién llama a quién; las métricas **RED** (*Rate, Errors, Duration*) salen de las trazas. Para investigar una petición lenta o fallida: tabla de abajo → clic en el ID de traza. Consulta libre: *Explore → Tempo* con TraceQL, por ejemplo `{resource.service.name=\"invoicing-service\" && duration > 2s}`."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Mapa de servicios",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "description": "Se dibuja con las llamadas reales vistas en las trazas (traces_service_graph_*). El grosor y el color de cada nodo indican tráfico y errores.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "serviceMap"
        }
      ],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones por servicio (Rate)",
      "description": "Peticiones por segundo que recibe cada servicio, según sus spans SERVER.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores por servicio (Errors)",
      "description": "Proporción de spans SERVER marcados con error (excepción o 5xx).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service=~\"$service\", status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service=~\"$service\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por servicio (Duration)",
      "description": "El 95 % de las peticiones a cada servicio tardó menos que esto.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (service, le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service=~\"$service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Endpoints más lentos (p95, rango seleccionado)",
      "description": "Endpoints de cada servicio ordenados por p95. Sirve para ver qué ruta concreta empeora la latencia de un flujo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (service, http_method, http_route, le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service=~\"$service\", http_route!=\"\"}[$__range])))"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "p95 (s)",
              "service": "Servicio",
              "http_method": "Método",
              "http_route": "Ruta"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "p95 (s)",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trazas con error o lentas (> 1 s)",
      "description": "Últimas trazas que tuvieron un error o tardaron más de 1 s. Clic en el ID para abrir la traza completa.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && (status = error || duration > 1s) && kind = server}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Servicio",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}, service)",
          "refId": "q"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}, service)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  }
}
